  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>P</mi></math> is true</p><p><math><mi>Q</mi></math> is False</p><p><math><mi>R</mi></math> is True</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>F</mi></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>F</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p>"
